{"slug":"sos-app","title":"Personal Safety App","desc":"Peoplesafe personal safety app with SOS alarm, live location and secure monitoring. Download our SOS app for instant help and peace of mind.","og":"https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/SOS-app-hero.png","content":"<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/hero {\"label\":\"Personal Safety App\",\"title\":\"SOS App \\u0026 SOS Alarm\",\"intro\":\"Peoplesafe’s personal safety app puts help in your pocket. Our SOS app activates an SOS alarm, shares live location, and alerts our monitoring team to get assistance fast.\",\"buttons\":[{\"linkText\":\"Book a Demo\",\"link\":\"\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"dialog\":\"demo-dialog\",\"variant\":\"\"},{\"linkText\":\"Get a Quote\",\"link\":\"/uk/get-your-quote/\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"dialog\":\"\",\"variant\":\"outline\"}],\"imageId\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/SOS-app-hero.png@@\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/trustpilot-widget {\"widget\":\"horizontal\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/top-tabs {\"tabs\":[{\"title\":\"SOS Alarm\",\"icon\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/SOS-Alarm.png@@\",\"iconUrl\":\"\",\"preTitle\":\"Help available 24/7\",\"heading\":\"Instant SOS Alarm\",\"content\":\"Receive emergency help faster than 999 with direct access to police control rooms.\",\"linkText\":\"Book a Demo\",\"link\":\"\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/sos-app-tab1.png@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\"},{\"title\":\"Share Location\",\"icon\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Pinpoint-location.png@@\",\"iconUrl\":\"\",\"preTitle\":\"Be trackable\",\"heading\":\"Share Location\",\"content\":\"Peace of mind for your employee and a nominated contact that their whereabouts are known. Location sharing can be done via SMS or an alternative message system (e.g., Facebook Messenger or WhatsApp). Live GPS tracking and location history is available to ARC Controllers when an alarm is raised.\",\"linkText\":\"Book a Demo\",\"link\":\"\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/1111.png@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\"},{\"title\":\"Discreet Alarm\",\"icon\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/discreet.png@@\",\"iconUrl\":\"\",\"preTitle\":\"Don't raise suspicions\",\"heading\":\"SOS Alarm and Silent Alert\",\"content\":\"Avoid escalating situations by raising an alarm without using the SOS button by pressing the power button or using preset shortcuts (iOS only).\",\"linkText\":\"Book a Demo\",\"link\":\"\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/sos-app-tab3.png@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\"},{\"title\":\"Travelsafe\",\"icon\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/travelsafe-icon.png@@\",\"iconUrl\":\"\",\"preTitle\":\"Safer travels\",\"heading\":\"Travelsafe\",\"content\":\"Get staff safely from A to B using our specialised service for journeys. Our unique app feature protects your people throughout their journey, with welfare checks along the way.\",\"linkText\":\"Read about Travelsafe\",\"link\":\"/uk/products/travelsafe/\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/sos-app-tab4.png@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\"},{\"title\":\"Monitor Me\",\"icon\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/monitor-me2.png@@\",\"iconUrl\":\"\",\"preTitle\":\"Safety companion\",\"heading\":\"Monitor me\",\"content\":\"An Alarm Controller will stay in contact with your people if they feel unsafe until the danger passes.\",\"linkText\":\"Book a Demo\",\"link\":\"\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/sos-app-tab2.png@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\"}]} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media {\"title\":\"Enhanced peace of mind\",\"buttons\":[{\"linkText\":\"Book a Demo\",\"link\":\"\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"dialog\":\"demo-dialog\",\"variant\":\"\"}],\"mediaType\":\"video\",\"videoUrl\":\"https://vimeo.com/663393132\"} -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The Peoplesafe SOS App provides employees with reassurance that help is available at a push of a button if they feel vulnerable or unsafe.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Unlike other <a href=\"/uk/products/smart-button/\">panic alarms</a> and safe walk apps, the Peoplesafe SOS App is supported by Peoplesafe’s 24/7 control centre, offering unrivalled employee protection when it’s needed the most.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Whether they are commuting at unsociable hours or have to <a href=\"/uk/blogs/16-safety-tips-for-commuting-safely-in-the-dark/\">walk in the dark</a> to a car park, the Peoplesafe SOS App is the perfect companion.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- /wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media -->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media {\"title\":\"How the SOS Alarm works\",\"mediaType\":\"video\",\"videoUrl\":\"https://vimeo.com/841920708\",\"mediaPosition\":\"left\"} -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Your employees are protected 24/7/365 by our dedicated <a href=\"/uk/alarm-receiving-centre/\">Alarm Receiving Centre (ARC)</a>. We provide the quickest response in an emergency with the simple press of the SOS alarm, or through raising a discreet alarm.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>4 seconds to pick up alarms</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>4 minute police response in threat-to-life situations</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>100% service uptime</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n<!-- /wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media -->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/quote {\"quotes\":[{\"quote\":\"“We believe colleagues will really value the peace of mind offered by knowing that their journey is being monitored and help is quickly available if they encounter any issues. They deserve to always feel and be safe, at work or in their personal lives.”\",\"attribution\":\"Rachel Bennett, Shrink and Security Director\",\"logo\":0,\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/tesco-logo.png@@\",\"logoUrl\":\"\",\"imageUrl\":\"\"},{\"quote\":\"“The app’s an additional layer of safety. We hope no one ever needs to activate an alarm but it’s important we give people that option to call for help fast. We hope all of our people will use the app to have peace of mind and support if and when they need it.”\",\"attribution\":\"Adam Elsworth, Safety Director\",\"logo\":0,\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/openreach-logo-website.png@@\",\"logoUrl\":\"\",\"imageUrl\":\"\"},{\"quote\":\"“We decided to offer the Peoplesafe service across all roles. Our goal is to support each other and provide an employee benefit that protects staff while at work and travelling. Giving them access to Peoplesafe means they have the peace of mind that they are supported with a professional service should anything unexpected happen.”\",\"attribution\":\"Steve Low, Regional Health \\u0026 Safety Officer\",\"logo\":0,\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/dignity-case-study-logo.png@@\",\"logoUrl\":\"\",\"imageUrl\":\"\"}]} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media {\"preTitle\":\"Key safety app features\",\"title\":\"Why choose our SOS App for personal safety\",\"imageId\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/pexels-andrea-piacquadio-3764557-1024x683.jpg@@\",\"framed\":false} -->\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>100% of alarms answered by trained professionals 24/7 to respond when needed most</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Enterprise-grade service that can be provided at scale</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Get help faster than 999 with direct access to police control rooms</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Immediate help direct to the user’s exact location using GPS coordinates</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Audio evidence recorded from alarm that can be used in court</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Securely held personal data to prevent data breaches</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n<!-- /wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media -->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media {\"title\":\"Download eBook\",\"buttons\":[{\"linkText\":\"Download eBook\",\"link\":\"https://insights.peoplesafe.co.uk/story/peoplesafe-sos-app-e-book-download/page/1?teaser=yes\",\"linkTarget\":true,\"dialog\":\"\",\"variant\":\"outline\"}],\"imageId\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/sos-app-eBook-turtl.jpg@@\",\"framed\":false,\"mediaPosition\":\"left\"} -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Want to learn more about how the Peoplesafe personal safety app can enhance the feelings of safety and security of all your workers?</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Download our comprehensive product eBook for detailed information on its features and benefits.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Discover how the Peoplesafe app provides reliable protection, rapid response, and advanced technology to ensure the wellbeing of your employees in any situation.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://insights.peoplesafe.co.uk/story/peoplesafe-sos-app-e-book-download/page/1?teaser=yes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Download eBook</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- /wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media -->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media {\"title\":\"Proactively manage people risk\",\"imageId\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/nexus-hero-1.png@@\",\"framed\":false} -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Add people, allocate apps and monitor usage from our award-winning Nexus platform. Connect your staff, managers and our ARC in one place for simple people management.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Managers have a comprehensive 360º view of an employee’s safety in one location, including contact details, medical information, voice notes and activity timers. You can also see device specific information such as battery life, last known position and serial number.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Visually engaging reports provide actionable insights on user engagement with the service so you can make changes to improve personal security.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- /wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"textAlign\":\"center\"}}} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Our Accreditations</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/image-columns {\"style\":\"cards\",\"items\":[{\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/02/ISO-27001-1.png@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\",\"text\":\"\\u003cstrong\\u003eISO 27001: 2017\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWe adhere to information security best practice and deliver the highest standard of data security to our clients.\"},{\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/02/iso9001-logo-300x196-1.jpg@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\",\"text\":\"\\u003cstrong\\u003eISO 9001: 2015\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eOur service is thoughtfully planned, implemented, measured and maintained. Take a look at our \\u003ca href=\\\"/uk/quality-policy/\\\"\\u003eQuality Policy\\u003c/a\\u003e statement.\"},{\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/02/cyber-essentials.png@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\",\"text\":\"\\u003cstrong\\u003eCyber Essentials Plus\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWe have the highest certification after being independently assessed to ensure our systems and information are cybersafe.\"},{\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/50518.png@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\",\"text\":\"\\u003cstrong\\u003eBS EN 50518:2019\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eOur Alarm Receiving Centre (ARC) is a category I which is designed, constructed and operated to a higher standard than a category II.\"}]} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/faq {\"title\":\"FAQs about the personal safety app and SOS alarm\",\"faqs\":[{\"question\":\"What do personal safety apps do?\",\"answer\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eThe most basic function of a personal safety app is to contact pre-selected emergency contacts with your location. This is likely to be friends and family members within your phone’s contacts.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003ePersonal safety apps can also provide location tracking and enable you to share your location with trusted contacts in real-time.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"question\":\"Are personal safety apps effective?\",\"answer\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eThey can be a valuable tool for feeling safer. However, free versions that rely on family and friends to respond may not be effective in all situations.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"question\":\"How do I raise an SOS alarm?\",\"answer\":\"\\u003cp\\u003ePress and hold the SOS button for 4 seconds. Alternatively, with discreet alarm functions enabled you can shake the handset, or (Android handsets only) you can press the lock button a preset number of times.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"question\":\"Is my location always being shared?\",\"answer\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eNo – we only use your location data when you raise an alarm or share location. This data is only available to our accredited control centre or chosen contact. We will never share data with 3rd party companies.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"question\":\"Why is the Peoplesafe SOS app better than free apps?\",\"answer\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eIt is supported by a 24/7 professional control centre with average response times of just 3 seconds. Due to Peoplesafe’s accreditations, we can connect to the emergency services directly getting help faster than calling 999\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eWhile free personal safety apps are proven to increase confidence and feelings of safety, they rely on family and friends to react in an emergency situation.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"question\":\"How do I download the Peoplesafe app?\",\"answer\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eThe Peoplesafe SOS app is available to download from both the Apple Store and the Play Store. Before gaining access to the app’s features, your employer will need to have purchased a subscription.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"}]} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/cta-banner {\"theme\":\"orange\",\"title\":\"See how it works\",\"content\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eTo get a personal safety app demo, contact our experts using the form below.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/form {\"formUrl\":\"https://safe.peoplesafe.co.uk/l/830213/2024-07-16/2jj3qk\",\"height\":550} /-->","menu_order":4,"types":["safety-apps"]}